     "titulo": "Structure of an enquiry",
     "texto": [
      "In the subject line (**Emne**) summarise the topic: **Spørsmål om påmelding**. Open with **Hei** or **God dag**, explain why you're writing and separate the questions so they're easy to answer. Close with **Takk på forhånd** and **Med vennlig hilsen**."
     ],
